+// VFPU prefixes known at generation time. A `vpfx` sets one; the next VFPU
+// instruction consumes all three. In every corpus seen so far the consumer is
+// in the same basic block (checked by prefixes_fold_safely() before emission),
+// so the generator knows the exact prefixes of every VFPU instruction: with
+// the defaults it emits the plain lane accessors (no run-time decode, no
